  "releaseNotes": "Initial release of FaultDiagnosisGuideModule.\n- Added AlertData, DiagnosisData, StepsFeedbackData, SupportData models\n- Implemented dynamic form configuration for serial/TCP settings\n- Supports .NET Framework 4.7.2 and .NET Standard 2.0",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "智能故障诊断引导模块，支持报警概览、交互式诊断、步骤引导与技术支持。",
